# Popol and Kupa, Icefield Companions

> Popol and Kupa is a marksman for players who want to decide where the fight can happen before it starts. He wins by shrinking the map with traps, tagging the first target that steps wrong, and cashing that mistake into tower pressure. Pick him when your draft wants controlled corridors, not when you need a free-scaling backline gunner.

