## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Pickoff (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Blade of Despair, Demon Hunter Sword, Great Dragon Spear, Malefic Gun, Wind of Nature
- Core: Blade of Despair, Demon Hunter Sword, Great Dragon Spear
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic or mixed burst when physical immunity will not stop the first dive.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Gun when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP front liners keep the first trapped target alive.; Immortality over Wind of Nature when Use when the game has reached one-death objective fights and the enemy cannot be answered by a single active immunity.
- Total cost: 12070 gold

Default gold lane setup that turns Popol's trap catch into a fast pick, then uses range or physical immunity to survive the answer.

### Front-to-Back Anti-Tank (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff, Sea Halberd, Malefic Roar
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, War Cry
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Malefic Roar when Use when a physical diver can cross the front line before Popol finishes the first durable target.; Malefic Gun over Malefic Roar when Use when safer basic-attack range matters more than scaling through stacked Physical Defense.; Rose Gold Meteor over Sea Halberd when Use against magic burst when the enemy front line is durable but not sustained by heavy healing or shields.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Tank-breaking setup for games where Popol is allowed to hit through a controlled choke while Kupa keeps applying attack effects.

### Jungle Tempo Pickoff (Jungle)

- Items: Swift Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Blade of Despair, Demon Hunter Sword, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Malefic Roar over Immortality when Use when the enemy stacks armor and Popol can still enter objective fights from prepared trap angles.; Wind of Nature over Immortality when Use when physical burst reaches Popol before Kupa's peel and traps can reset the fight.; Sea Halberd over Demon Hunter Sword when Use when anti-heal is mandatory before the enemy sustain core can take over Turtle or Lord fights.
- Total cost: 11980 gold

Jungle variant for snowball drafts that want Kupa's creep control, early pickoff damage, and Ice Retribution chase around objectives.

